<h3 class="navi-title">Privacy Policy</h3>

<h4>what i store</h4>
<p>
  when you make an account on this board, i store your username, email address,
  password hash, and avatar (if you upload one). i also store the date of your
  last login and the date of your account creation.
</p>

<h4>cookies</h4>
<p>
  i use a single session cookie to keep you logged in. it contains a signed
  token with your username and email address, lasts 7 days, and is never
  accessible to JavaScript. there are no tracking or analytics cookies.
</p>

<h4>what i do with your data</h4>
<p>
  your email address is only used to activate your account and to help you
  recover it (password reset, re-activation after an email change). i do not
  send newsletters, and i do not share or sell your data to anyone.
</p>

<h4>your rights</h4>
<p>
  at any time, from your
  <a href="/profile/privacy">profile's Privacy tab</a>, you can:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>download a JSON copy of all the data we hold about you;</li>
  <li>delete your account, permanently and immediately.</li>
</ul>

<h4>data retention</h4>
<p>
  your data is kept for as long as your account exists. deleting your account
  removes it from our database right away. note: your posts and threads will be
  kept, if you want to delete them, contact me
</p>

<h4>contact</h4>
<p>for any privacy question, contact the board administrator.</p>
